land-atlas/wisconsin/dodge-county"],["ARC or PLC in Dodge County","/arc-plc/wisconsin/dodge-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids in Dodge County came in under 90% of normal in August to September 36 times in 75 years since 1951, the most of any pair. In 2025 that middle ran 33% of normal in January to February and 57% in September to October. So far in 2026 it shows 196% in March to April and 62% in May to June. Grid 28064 had its driest year in 1958 at 58%.</p>"}
